<title>UK: Goldman sets warrants on Heineken.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets warrants on Heineken.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued American-style call warrants, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    307 NLG		   PREMIUM	10.22 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.42 DEM		  GEARING	8.0 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.SEP.96-18.SEP.98   PAYDATE	26.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING(APPLIED)DUSS, FRFT, STUTT     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
